    "$t": "光景bóng uē - 鷄籠主普壇ê中元普渡科儀"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《鷄籠主普壇ê中元普渡科儀》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/賴文龍</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgaXgIfqVdmOWTdnI9kRqyuiiGkJBnJJKy7mj4yhzkprkIfH3FASvlUt0qYM5WuFIY1J1wXxhpiECZKUFdS9DPw7RJxy0yl8KAujsE16MFo0jYn4MQB0v8xaW6FxuVWdQLfpmB23Wo-UZQqgTupXZNlKjDJeYptWkBr8PmuYIBPIZzZKGch08h5hqazmqpU\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgaXgIfqVdmOWTdnI9kRqyuiiGkJBnJJKy7mj4yhzkprkIfH3FASvlUt0qYM5WuFIY1J1wXxhpiECZKUFdS9DPw7RJxy0yl8KAujsE16MFo0jYn4MQB0v8xaW6FxuVWdQLfpmB23Wo-UZQqgTupXZNlKjDJeYptWkBr8PmuYIBPIZzZKGch08h5hqazmqpU=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjDyxenGEBCJqno-LErBLRus0c_YnuZ0ObFCf7af9D_S7Cjej65jCCaZwLEaGagy-ViLvMnBGr8bv0tVz-tNhbFTnTq4tL9SDpxhRMHNavu5EXHVCadH7wq5FB5UU3w_LoDhSjMSs-w9Kyut9ry3CAI4_kuQqtVGlqt6TIozkArXpm2QqKHuMi3JM5HzoRm\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjDyxenGEBCJqno-LErBLRus0c_YnuZ0ObFCf7af9D_S7Cjej65jCCaZwLEaGagy-ViLvMnBGr8bv0tVz-tNhbFTnTq4tL9SDpxhRMHNavu5EXHVCadH7wq5FB5UU3w_LoDhSjMSs-w9Kyut9ry3CAI4_kuQqtVGlqt6TIozkArXpm2QqKHuMi3JM5HzoRm=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhXvb6SQmhwPRX2oX0Hv_fu-ZnRIZiAaJbMq2lSA7a_4sHoxwAJacTUqxL9L3GjUyzWjAucXhZWJR6UyNxmGAgWa_zuyZ3-hC202xf1u_eNEDR63iwZ1cNcMvRknZhKfha1FTcv1IV6KgETXWW18BYo-KV7t0QBmhIUcZSJFd7IyTLteMAixW-x2geMq-RK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3550\" data-original-width=\"4734\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhXvb6SQmhwPRX2oX0Hv_fu-ZnRIZiAaJbMq2lSA7a_4sHoxwAJacTUqxL9L3GjUyzWjAucXhZWJR6UyNxmGAgWa_zuyZ3-hC202xf1u_eNEDR63iwZ1cNcMvRknZhKfha1FTcv1IV6KgETXWW18BYo-KV7t0QBmhIUcZSJFd7IyTLteMAixW-x2geMq-RK=w640-h480\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Lán人ê 7月15暗時，tī基隆ê主普壇有「鷄籠中元普渡」ê科儀。啥mi̍h是科儀？科儀就是sio連suà ê典禮儀式，一般ê典禮kan-na一場niā-niā，辦完就煞鼓，基隆ê中元祭tī 7--月ê規個月lóng有各種ê典禮，所以lán kā總稱做科儀。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Uì 7月初1子時，tī老大公廟開龕門開始，11 tshāi燈篙，12主普壇開燈放彩，13 ngiâ斗燈，15暗tī主普壇辦中元普渡。前一工，14暗放水燈，邀請好兄弟來食普渡，一直到8月初1關龕門，án-ne ê安排mā不止仔合理、順序。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">普渡ê排桌，頭前是豬公kah羊，後面分四區，有西洋桌、菜桌、tsho桌kah組合桌。1883到1885年，清國kah法蘭西國戰爭，tī北台灣ê基隆kah淡水是戰場，歷史號做「西仔反」戰爭。Tī基隆ê安瀾橋附近有法國公墓，逐年舊曆7--月，大沙灣社區ē辦活動，記念íng過戰死往生ê人，有「清國公」kah「西仔公」，西仔公就是外國人，所以，lán ê祭品內面有tshuân法國pháng、紅酒kah西餐，tse就是西洋桌。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">現代ê人不比khah早，khah無閒mā khah hân-bān tshuân beh普ê萬項mi̍h件，一寡仔腦筋動khah緊ê廠商mā掠著tsit點，只要客戶出錢，廠商就替人tshuân一个普渡mi̍h ê組合包，參落去普，án-ne對逐家lóng利便，tse就是組合桌。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">另外，基隆ê普渡對在地人、西洋人kah好兄弟lóng tsiânn好禮，m̄管是食tsho、食菜、外國人kah現代ê無閒人lóng有用心考慮--著，m̄-nā是án-ne，對囡仔mā真友善。主普單位對囡仔ê亡靈mā真尊tshûn，tī普渡ê桌面有排囡仔造形ê尪仔pháng，另外koh準備一區，lóng囥囡仔ê tshit-thô-mi̍h。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">普渡現場大部份ê祭品，tī典禮完成了後，lóng ē-sái hōo人自由提倒tńg--去，連拜拜ê豬公mā現場現liô，想beh愛ê人mā ē-sái排隊去提一份。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">基隆ê中元普渡科儀文化，講--起-來tsiânn有人情味kah歷史性，符合多元化、國際化，koh有包容性，對在世ê人有照顧，對所有ê亡靈好兄弟有尊重，是一場有歷史、有意義ê文化活動。</span></div></div><br /><h2><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 378期，2025年9月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left;\"></p></div></span></div></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: prese